hould address godotengine/godot#117497.\r\n\r\n*Bugsquad edit:* Fixes #117497.\r\n\r\nAs of writing, we only update `Node3DEditorViewport::EditData::snap` in `Node3DEditorViewport::begin_transform`. This works well when the user toggles snapping before modifying a `Node3D`'s transform.\r\n\r\nThat said, if the user is pressing and releasing the Ctrl/Cmd key while adjusting a transform, snapping won't necessarily enable/disable.\r\n\r\n~~To address this, we update the state of `snap` in `Node3DEditorViewport::update_transform`. This allows the user to toggle snapping while adjusting a `Node3D`'s transform.~~\r\n\r\nWe now check the snapping state dynamically. See [below](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117606#issuecomment-4094744134).\r\n\r\n## Notes\r\nNo generative AI was used in the research, development, or testing of this PR's changes.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","number":24,"state":"closed","title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://ava